  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Header.png\" alt=\"Pastel Shader's logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"324\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ffe8e9&amp;labelColor=ffced2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=blue\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-IRIS,%20OCULUS,%20OPTIFINE%20|%201.7%20to%201.20-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\" />&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/elocindev\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-支持作者-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Ko-Fi&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\" /></a></em><em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/ELOCIN\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1018\" height=\"151\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pastel Shaders 是一款风格化的美学光影包，提供多种色彩预设</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066006073456197652/presets-transparent.gif\" alt=\"Pastel Shaders 包含的三种预设\" width=\"1200\" height=\"608\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066223943956041748/highperformance.png\" alt=\"Pastel 是一款高性能光影\" width=\"1120\" height=\"567\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>🎨 多种色彩预设</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">从粉色调、蓝色调到黄色调的柔和配色方案任君选择！&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>🌌 宁静氛围</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;近乎原版的体验，搭配清澈的星空。美丽的日出和日落。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>✏️ 高度可定制</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;无论新手还是高级用户，都能轻松实现近乎无限的自定义！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>⚙️ 用户友好的设置菜单</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;太多设置让你眼花缭乱？Pastel 提供类似大多数现代游戏的快捷设置。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>💻&nbsp;兼容多数现代电脑</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;专为现代低端显卡甚至集成显卡优化！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>☁️ <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/insanity-shader\">Insanity 光影包</a>的姊妹作品</strong></span>\n<p>Pastel 是与 Insanity 相对的版本，后者基于 BSL Shaders &hearts;！</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
